  "answer": "Fixed and verified.\n\n**The bug** — `src/ledger.ts` accumulated in the wrong direction:\n\n```ts\nsum -= entry.amount   // subtracted every entry\n```\n\n**The fix** — one-line sign change so each entry is added:\n\n```ts\nsum += entry.amount\n```\n\nExported shape (`Entry` interface, `total(entries: Entry[]): number`) is unchanged, and `test/oracle.test.ts` was not touched. This also keeps the intended semantics for negative amounts: `total([{ amount: -3 }])` returns `-3`, since an entry's own sign is preserved rather than inverted.\n\n**Test result** — `bun test`:\n\n```\ntest/oracle.test.ts:\n(pass) totals add [0.15ms]\n\n 1 pass\n 0 fail\n 3 expect() calls\nRan 1 test across 1 file.\n```"
